ould  manage in his nearly prone state and as  he hoped its tip embedded itself in the  more stable ground past the edge of the  Death Pit with the spear firmly secured  at the other end the chain went taut and  Abel was able to stop himself just short  of falling on  scp-682's facial spikes with a  tremendous one-handed swing that would  be impossible for a mortal man Abel cut  through the middle of the lizard's  organic bayonets rendering them  practically useless his metal boots dug  into the slit and with all his strength  he wrenched himself backwards towards  the top of the pit tearing the Harpoon  free in the process with acute Precision  he used the chain to direct the tip of  the Harpoon between the fractured bone  blades and into 682's skull the creature  bellowed from the sudden pain and began  to dig downward again but by this time  Abel was on stable Earth again and was  pulling with all his strength on the  other side of the chain  scp-682 burrowed as furiously as it  could but the Harpoon embedded in its  head was throwing off its equilibrium  Abel planted his feet and kept pulling  summoning more weapons around his feet  and legs to keep them from moving an  inch back toward the pit it was a  Titan's tug of war and whoever gave in  would surely be at the mercy of the  other neither monster wavered and the  thing that broke Under The Strain was  the chain itself 682 tunnel the way  Harpoon still scratching its brain and  did not surface again that night while  the black Warrior staggered as he  retrieved his now broken length of chain  Abel waited for his hated foe to  resurface but the creature had  apparently decided it was no longer  interested in a fight and it was just as  well because in the East the sun was  Rising again the black Warrior moved  inside one of the tents that the  survivors had left behind and prepared  for a full examination of his armor  while it didn't last and no SCP save for  scp-001 could claim victory here Abel  was grateful to know there were still  proper adversaries to fight after the  end want to own an SCP of your own go to  scpswag.com for premium anomalous  merchandise now go check out could  scp-076 able survive scp-001 when day  breaks and scp-001 when daybreaks  scp-682 to see how it all started
 

